Copyright 2025 The Paper Mono Project Authors (https://github.com/paper-design/paper-mono)

This file is a subset of paper_mono, made by "kerneltool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126 and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(2 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables;
the character 0 is the glyph 304 of the source, the slashed zero of its
feature zero. The subset carries the name "Paper Mono ASCII".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, no Reserved Font Name.

